<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-MARSEILLE OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MARSEILLE OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MARSEILLE, France 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinals results in</p>
<p>the $539,250 Marseille Open men's tennis tournament on Saturday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Fabrice Santoro (France) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>1-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Sergi Bruguera (Spain) 6-3 6-7</p>
<p>(3-7) 6-4</p>
</text>
